rows.elements_checklist:
33.3(4)(A) (A) the Person's name;
33.3(4)(B) (B) the service provided to the Person;
33.3(4)(C) (C) date range the summary covers;
33.3(4)(D) (D) details of all employment activities;
33.3(4)(E) (E) the Person's response to the service;
33.3(4)(F) (F) information that indicates the progress towards the Person's employment goals;
33.3(4)(G) (G) documentation of the data collected from the weekly assessment with the Person as outlined in 33.2(j);
33.3(4)(H) (H) name of the Staff writing the monthly summary; and

34.3(1) (1) verification of the Person's start date of employment;
34.3(2) (2) a copy of the Person's current pay stub including hours worked and hourly wage;
34.3(3) (3) electronic documentation uploaded to UPI evidencing the Person had informed choice in obtaining their job placement in Competitive Integrated Employment; and
34.3(4) (4) a summary including: (A) how the Contractor was the primary source in assisting the Person to obtain Community Integrated Employment; (B) how the Person's employment meets the Person's employment goals; and (C) the Person's satisfaction with their employment.

35.3(1) (1) verification of the Person's start date of employment;
35.3(2) (2) a copy of the Person's current pay stub including hours worked and hourly wage;
35.3(3) (3) electronic documentation in the UPI evidencing the Person had informed choice in retaining their job placement in Competitive Integrated Employment;
